<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Launch animation (Android 12+), a vector rendition of the app icon artwork, 1 s:
       0–320 ms   gauge rotates in and grows; the tick ring fades in
     100–800 ms   the teal → cyan → blue arc (with its glow) sweeps round like a speed test
     380–680 ms   the silver knob pops in
     650–1000 ms  a soft cyan ring pulses out from the knob
     Generated to match the icon's colours; pure vector, animates at any resolution. -->
